{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">InOut is a level based minimalist puzzle platformer that combines mind bending puzzles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">with challenging precision platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806980/extras/Movie_026.gif?t=1750283451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a small, yellow creature with two curious eyes. Not knowing where you are </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or why you're there, you begin to explore uncovering messages that slowly reveal </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the truth about your surroundings and your purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806980/extras/Movie_028.gif?t=1750283451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 levels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Approximately 30-45 minutes of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden areas and secrets to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging boss fight with multiple phases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introduction to the main mechanic of the game:<strong> Map</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806980?t=1750283451","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806980/d7efa4c6bb13e9d247d8ab29b688e608f4b80ee0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750283451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806980/fee46ee6de1b0bc57a03f92530a62d8867811f36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750283451","capsule_im